Column name: Has_Omni_Genotypes Type: BOOLEAN Description: Omni Genotypes in ftp://ftp.1000genomes.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/ftp/technical/working/20120131_omni_genotypes_and_intensities/Omni25_genotypes_2141_samples.b37.vcf.gz   
